{"id":2613,"date":"2024-11-21T05:35:06","date_gmt":"2024-11-20T22:35:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/?p=2613"},"modified":"2024-11-21T05:35:06","modified_gmt":"2024-11-20T22:35:06","slug":"kegiatan-rekrutmen-kampus-kerjasama-pt-denso-manufacturing-dengan-politeknik-stmi-jakarta","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/kegiatan-rekrutmen-kampus-kerjasama-pt-denso-manufacturing-dengan-politeknik-stmi-jakarta\/","title":{"rendered":"Kegiatan Rekrutmen Kampus Kerjasama PT Denso Manufacturing dengan Politeknik STMI Jakarta"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Halo Sobat STMI!<\/p>\n<p>Pada hari ini, Rabu 20 November 2024 telah dilaksanakan Kegiatan Rekrutmen Kampus Kerjasama PT Denso Manufacturing dengan Politeknik STMI Jakarta<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2614 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-4-240x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-4-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-4-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-4-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-4.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Kegiatan ini merupakan bentuk salah satu kerjasama Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT Denso untuk membuka peluang karir bagi lulusan Politeknik STMI Jakarta<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2620 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-2-240x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-2-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-2-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-2-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-2.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Halo Sobat STMI! Pada hari ini, Rabu 20 November 2024 telah dilaksanakan Kegiatan Rekrutmen Kampus Kerjasama PT Denso Manufacturing dengan Politeknik STMI Jakarta Kegiatan ini merupakan bentuk salah satu kerjasama Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT Denso untuk membuka peluang karir bagi lulusan Politeknik STMI Jakarta<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":2614,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[28,22],"tags":[30,23],"class_list":["post-2613","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-berita","category-berita-kampus","tag-beritakampus","tag-berita-kampus"],"blocksy_meta":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2613","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2613"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2613\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2622,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2613\/revisions\/2622"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2614"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2613"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2613"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=2613"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}